  description="The terms that apply to using ismailoyeleke.com, including ownership of the content, links to other sites, and the limits of what the site promises."
  updated="6 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    These terms apply to ismailoyeleke.com, a personal portfolio run by {site.name} from{' '}
    {site.locality}, {site.country}. Using the site means you accept them. If you do not, please do
    not use the site.
