  <h2>What this site is</h2>
  <p>
    It is a portfolio: a record of professional work, certifications and writing, and a way to get
    in touch. It is not a product, it sells nothing, and it takes no payment.
  </p>

  <h2>Content and ownership</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      The text, design, photography and code of this site belong to me, except where something is
      credited to someone else.
    </li>
    <li>
      You are welcome to quote or link to it with attribution. Republishing it wholesale, or
      presenting it as your own work, is not permitted.
    </li>
    <li>
      Client projects are described with the clients' agreement. Screenshots are redacted where they
