  <p>
    This site links to GitHub, YouTube, Medium, Credly, LinkedIn, client sites and certification
    issuers. I do not control those sites and I am not responsible for their content, their terms or
    their privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Contacting me</h2>
  <p>
    Messages sent through the contact form are read by me. Please do not send confidential
    information, credentials or personal data about other people through it. Sending a message does
    not create a contract or a professional engagement; any work is agreed separately in writing.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not attempt to break, probe or disrupt the site or its hosting.</li>
    <li>Do not use the contact form for unsolicited marketing or automated submissions.</li>
    <li>Do not scrape the site to build a competing listing or a dataset.</li>
