  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria, and the courts of
    Nigeria have jurisdiction over any dispute.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    I may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they last changed. Continuing to use
    the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or{' '}
